    "## **Task C3**: Find and visualize most compact vs most stretched frames\n",
    "\n",
    "Find one example frame where the defensive lines look very compact and another where they are very stretched.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Goal**: \n",
    "- Identify the most compact and most stretched defensive frames\n",
    "- Plot both frames on the pitch\n",
    "- Analyze what might have caused the difference"
   ]
